This product bundles the official Treasure AI CLI (@treasuredata/tdx),
Copyright Treasure Data, Inc.

  https://tdx.treasuredata.com/

The bundled CLI is redistributed unmodified and is started as a child
process (`tdx mcp`). A launcher (server/index.js) proxies the MCP
protocol between the client and that process in order to enforce the
configured permission mode.
